//! DEDUP (run at authoring, the named vocabularies over
//! `src/domains/kernel_opt/corpus/`):
//! - rule 1 (`fusion|residual|operand|negat|identity|uninit|ADD
//!   operand`): zero prior owners of the negated-op-class
//!   operand-mispick face — `negat*` hits are sign negation
//!   (`gfni-sign-mask-expand-cmpeq-fallback` branch-free negate,
//!   `env-polarity-migration` polarity migration), `identity` hits are
//!   descriptor-write memos (`descriptor-set-binding-memo-destroy-epoch`)
