//!   identity ELEMENT a masked lane writes) and role-scoped stores
//!   (`role-scoped-store-must-match-compute-guard` B118) — neither is
//!   an operand SELECTION.
//! - rule 2 (`mla|allowlist|exact.shape|strided.view|kv.view|DKQ`):
//!   `allowlist` hits are the sanitizer-env sense only
//!   (`env-gate-reaches-and-arms-the-scored-process`); the strided-view
//!   owners are `vendor-batched-gemm-contiguity-staging` (B77 —
//!   pointer-array layout into a vendor library), the B170 rider on
//!   `fuse-gate-up-gemv-activation` (a consumption view-shape hazard),
//!   and `strided-view-offset-fit32-launch-proof` (B195 — 32-bit
//!   offset safety, a different question); `MLA` hits are the cache
//!   family (`append-cache-rewind-overwrite-in-place` B39, the
//!   rewind_mla_caches_to lane — cited as family adjacency) and the
//!   vLLM fused_mla_key_concat rider (quantize/store fusion); `DKQ`
//!   and `kv.view` zero. None owns an FA admission widening or a V-view
//!   descriptor mode.
//! - rule 3 (`headless|draft|catch-up|cache.write|mtp|nextn|crop`):
//!   `headless`/`nextn`/`catch-up`/`crop` ZERO; `mtp` hits are the B129
//!   draft-selection readback rider (quoted in-rule on
//!   `device-side-argmax-minimal-download` B25) and the spec-decode
//!   commit family (`gdn-transition-replay-log-commit-many`); the
//!   zero-row owners are the PAD family
//!   (`zero-pad-ragged-tail-additive-identity` B186,
//!   `pad-tail-to-fixed-tile` B84 — zero rows MANUFACTURED as additive
//!   identities FOR compute, the inverse posture of this rule's zero
//!   rows BECAUSE no consumer) and the nearest consumer-set elision kin
//!   `lm-head-loss-positions-only` (B37 — a per-position subset inside
//!   a live forward; this rule is the whole-graph zero-row case).
//! Honesty flags: rule 2 records the F16-scores sub-commit as a watch
